VESTA element colour table
=========================

crates/model/src/canvas_theme/vesta.rs, the VESTA theme and the VESTA generator
reference use VESTA's element colours (K. Momma and F. Izumi,
https://jp-minerals.org/vesta/), as tabulated under the `VESTA` key of
pymatgen's ElementColorSchemes.yaml:
https://github.com/materialsproject/pymatgen/blob/master/src/pymatgen/vis/ElementColorSchemes.yaml

The 109 RGB values (H through Mt) were converted to a Rust table in ReShiki's
element order. The file is part of pymatgen:

